893	For signal-based methods, define alignment $\alpha = \mathbb{E}[\Delta F_1(A_s) \mid \mathcal{D}_{\neg D}] / G_{\text{nd}} \in [0,1]$. Direct substitution yields $\mathbb{E}[\Delta F_1(A_s)] = (1{-}D) \cdot G_{\text{nd}} \cdot \alpha$.
